<title>USA: Xerox to delay launch of Accent product.</title>
<headline>Xerox to delay launch of Accent product.</headline>
<dateline>EAST HARTFORD, Conn 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Accent Color Sciences Inc said Friday one of its customers, Xerox Corp will likely launch one of its products onto the market at a later date than expected.</p>
<p>Accent, which makes high-speed, color printing systems, said the delay was due to a change that it made to the program and testing requirements of the product.</p>
</text>
